WEBVTT

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:05.580
I wonder what it will be?

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.540
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.470
It's an Earthbound Immortal!

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:12.970
It's a lizard geoglyph!

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:14.990
What's going to happen to us?

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:44.500
Your mentor Divine will soon be gone.

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:46.220
Divine?

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:50.880
If you want to rescue him, 
you have to defeat me first.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:54.520
If you're capable of defeating me, that is.

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:59.300
Black Rose Witch, it's your turn.

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:01.270
My turn!

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:04.220
Due to Reptilianne Gorgon's 
effect, your Black Rose

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:07.220
Dragon has turned into stone 
and has 0 attack points.

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:15.360
However, as long as Savage Colosseum is on the 
field, monsters in attack position must attack.

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:20.060
But since it's turned into 
stone, it can't move.

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:25.060
Reptilianne Gorgon, send Black 
Rose Dragon to the grave!

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:38.060
This power rivals the 
power of psychic dueling.

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:43.400
Psychic dueling is far weaker than 
the power of the Dark Signers.

00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:02.690
Looking over a vast distance

00:02:02.950 --> 00:02:07.790
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:12.700
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:17.470
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:22.830
No matter how bad today is

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.820
There’s still the faintest light

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:33.220
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:37.280
Is light it myself

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:42.290
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:47.260
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:53.560
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:57.540
Today will never exist again

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:03.440
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:33.460
Descend!  Two Earthbound Immortals

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:37.950
What's wrong?  Why do you look so surprised?

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:42.630
Is it unusual that there's a duel that's 
more terrifying than psychic duels?

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:47.280
Show me your power, Black Rose Witch!

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:50.690
Your magical power that spreads 
fear among the people!

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:58.290
Due to Savage Colosseum's effect, I gain 300 
life points for every monster that battles!

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:00.230
My attack is only beginning!

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:03.230
I activate my trap Synchro Spirits!

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:07.340
By removing a Synchro Monster 
in my graveyard from

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:11.340
play, I can Special Summon its 
Synchro Material Monsters.

00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:17.520
By removing Black Rose Dragon from play, I 
Special Summon Twilight Rose Knight and Lord Poison.

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:23.610
Next, I activate a trap!

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:28.450
With Dimension Reversion, all monsters that 
were removed from play return to the deck.

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:32.550
Black Rose Dragon is back in my deck.

00:04:32.550 --> 00:04:40.980
That's fine.  If you keep bringing out 
Black Rose Dragon, I'll keep destroying it.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:45.230
I activate the trap card Urgent Tuning.

00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:50.020
I can Synchro Summon one Synchro 
Monster during the Battle Phase!

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:55.190
Level 3 Twilight Rose Knight 
tunes Level 4 Lord Poison!

00:04:57.540 --> 00:05:02.670
The cold flame envelops the entire 
world.  Black flower, bloom!

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:04.630
Synchro Summon!

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:08.150
Appear, Black Rose Dragon!

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:17.590
When Black Rose Dragon is successfully Synchro 
Summoned, all cards on the field are destroyed.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:36.670
You were willing to destroy your own Black 
Rose Dragon in order to destroy my field.

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:43.350
It feels great that the Black Rose 
Witch is taking me seriously.

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:48.090
However, due to Field Barrier's effect, Black

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:52.090
Rose Dragon's effect can't 
destroy Savage Colosseum.

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:56.220
I don't know why you despise me.

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:58.740
However, I do know one thing.

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:01.530
You are seriously trying to kill me.

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:05.220
That means I also have to battle seriously!

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:09.340
You've always been doing that in duels!

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:15.800
In order to protect yourself, 
you keep destroying.

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:19.260
You don't care how many people are hurt.

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:24.120
You made them feel hopeless.  It's 
about time you feel the same thing!

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:26.650
Made them feel hopeless?

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:30.720
Yes.  You made me and my 
younger brother feel hopeless.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.190
I don't know your brother!

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:39.040
That's true.  My brother 
means nothing to you.

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:43.720
You killed my brother!

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:48.740
What?

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:57.750
Luca!

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:59.240
Yanagi!

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:00.300
You're okay!

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:01.820
Lua!

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:06.230
Luca and Grandpa, move!

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.210
Lua!  Wake up!

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:15.750
Himuro?

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:18.110
Are you okay?  You're not hurt, right?

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:18.810
Yeah.

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:20.670
I…

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:22.370
Oh yeah.

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:24.970
I attack you directly!

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:28.430
I lost in a duel against Divine.

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:31.830
How's Luca?

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:33.750
I'm right in front of your eyes.

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:36.240
Luca!  You're okay!

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:38.660
Sheesh, that's what I'm supposed to say.

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:40.520
But why am I here?

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:43.320
I don't know, but it's 
dangerous to stay here.

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:45.360
Yeah, let's escape right away!

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:51.240
My brother went to see you duel 
at the Daimon Area and died.

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:52.940
I don't know.

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:55.760
I don't know your brother.

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:59.110
I never met a young boy at that duel arena!

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:03.680
That boy admired you.  He was just a child.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.960
You have a power.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.140
You're superior to others 
and can rule over them.

00:08:10.140 --> 00:08:13.220
You could have used that 
power to save people!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:16.120
I don't have the power to save people!

00:08:17.150 --> 00:08:23.620
I only have a cursed power 
that keeps hurting me.

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:29.090
What's wrong, Luca?

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:33.320
Someone is dueling.

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:36.350
This deck…

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:38.500
Aki?

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:40.710
Luca!

00:08:40.710 --> 00:08:42.070
Wait!  It's dangerous!

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:44.190
You're a fool.

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:49.770
You're a foolish girl that only 
uses her powers for herself.

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:52.910
If you never existed, he would still be...

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:58.490
I don't forgive you!  I came 
back in order to get my revenge!

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:01.520
It's your turn!

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:04.180
Aki…

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:08.600
I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:10.780
Aki Izayoi?

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:11.630
Who's the opponent?

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:13.350
My turn!

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:16.570
That mark is…

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:20.110
The evil god that fought 
against the Crimson Dragon!

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:23.990
So she's a Dark Signer that 
Yusei was talking about?

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:26.620
But isn't that Misty?

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:29.280
That's Misty, the top model in the world!

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:30.070
What?

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:34.670
From my hand, I activate the 
spell card Reptilianne Spawn.

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:39.170
By removing a Reptilianne 
monster in my graveyard

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:42.970
from play, I can Special Summon 
two Reptilianne Tokens.

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:45.520
Next, I release the two Tokens.

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:51.630
I offer this soul to the 
god that resurrected me!

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:55.970
You're released from your long curse!  
Earthbound Immortal Ccarayhua!

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:11.410
This feels the same as that time with Kiryu!

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:17.450
What is this?

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:19.090
What's happening?

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:19.840
I don't know.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:24.070
But I can sense that this 
light is protecting us!

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:25.370
What?

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:26.460
What's that?

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:27.760
I'm scared!

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:41.530
What's happening?

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:55.540
This is the same as before.

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:02.880
What's this?

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:08.460
Don't worry.  An Earthbound Immortal 
can't take a Signer's soul.

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:11.490
At least not until the 
shadow duel is complete.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:25.660
What's this?

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:30.580
Where is it?

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:32.780
Where's the monster you summoned?

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:35.890
It's already right behind you.

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:48.490
What is this monster?

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:06.460
It seems the other duel is almost complete.

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:09.340
Divine?

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:33.260
If an Earthbound Immortal appears in the 
City, there will be many casualties.

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:37.060
But in my current state, I can't do anything!

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:49.320
Who is it?

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:51.340
My name is Dimak.

00:12:57.120 --> 00:13:06.300
Bommer, if the flame of revenge still 
burns in your heart, then come with me.

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:16.330
What's going on?

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:21.110
I'm preparing to plunge 
you into eternal darkness.

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:22.600
What?

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:26.430
Our duel hasn't been completed yet.

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:28.660
If you don't want to die, then fight!

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:36.710
I'll give you a chance, but only one turn!

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:40.250
Entertain me, Divine.

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:45.120
Dark Signer…  Her power is 
stronger than a psychic duelist's.

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:50.090
However, her power only 
activates during a duel.

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:52.740
That means it'll only lasts 
until I win the duel!

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:57.580
There's a reason why I'm the 
leader of Arcadia Movement!

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.660
My turn!

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:03.970
Her Field Spell Future Visions is a fearsome

00:14:03.970 --> 00:14:07.670
card that sends a summoned 
monster into the future.

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:10.850
If I just summon a monster, 
it won't stay on my field.

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:12.970
However, there's something I can do.

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:16.560
That effect only activates 
when I Normal Summon.

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:18.420
In that case...

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:21.300
I activate the Continuous 
Spell Teleport from my hand!

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:27.150
When you have a monster on your field 
when I have none, I can Special

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:33.150
Summon a Psychic-Type monster from my hand 
once per turn by paying 800 life points.

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:36.370
I Special Summon Storm Caller!

00:14:43.140 --> 00:14:46.630
Next up is the Equip Spell Premature Burial!

00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:49.640
By paying 800 life points, I Special Summon a

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:52.640
monster from the graveyard 
and equip it with this card!

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:56.310
I resurrect Magical Android!

00:14:57.360 --> 00:15:01.970
How's that?  Since it was a Special Summon, 
Future Visions's effect doesn't activate.

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:07.630
Go, Storm Caller!  Attack Fortune Lady Fire!

00:15:09.980 --> 00:15:11.460
I activate my trap!

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:12.760
Slip of Fortune!

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:21.690
When your monster attacks, by removing my attacked 
monster from play, your monster's attack is negated!

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:26.480
So you got rid of your own defending monster.

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:29.850
However, my Magical Android can still attack!

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:33.390
Magical Android, attack her directly!

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:41.630
Next, I summon Psychic Commander!

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:47.610
Future Visions's effect activates!

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:53.190
When you summon a monster, that monster is 
sent into the future until your next turn!

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.640
It's now the End Phase.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:59.040
I activate Magical Android's effect.

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:01.630
I gain life points equal to the number of

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:05.630
Psychic-Type monsters on my 
field multiplied by 600 points.

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:09.650
Our life points are about equal.

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:14.240
However, my Psychic Commander that was sent 
into the future will return on the next turn.

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:18.360
I can tune Psychic Commander 
with Magical Android.

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:24.970
That will let me Synchro Summon the most 
powerful monster in my deck, Thought Ruler Archfiend!

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:29.050
I'll win this duel!

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:33.020
My turn!

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:37.220
Due to the effects of Future 
Visions and Slip of Fortune,

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:41.420
Fortune Lady Light and Fortune 
Lady Fire return to my field!

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:45.300
Next, I release the two Fortune Ladies!

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:53.060
Again?

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:59.010
After five thousand years, the 
door to the afterlife opens again!

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:03.290
Our souls will feed the new world!

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:06.880
Descend, Earthbound Immortal Aslla Piscu!

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:18.340
You fool!  Though you act superior, 
you're still a third-rate duelist!

00:17:18.340 --> 00:17:24.140
When you Advanced Summoned, your summoned monster 
vanishes due to the effect of your own Future Visions!

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:28.200
I told you that I'm giving you 
a chance, but only for one turn.

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:29.160
What?

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:32.240
Earthbound Immortal Aslla 
Piscu's effect activates!

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:36.450
When this monster leaves the field, 
all your monsters are destroyed.

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:40.940
And for every monster that's destroyed, 
you take 800 points of damage!

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:41.870
What?

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:45.000
Where's the monster you summoned?

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:53.080
No way!

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:55.500
That's a gigantic monster!

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:58.990
Divine, vanish into eternal darkness!

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:04.870
Divine!

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:24.880
Divine!

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:34.630
This is bad!

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:41.120
I'll have to settle my battle 
with you some other time.

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:43.590
Izayoi, run!

00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:46.540
Himuro, if we don't hurry up and 
escape, we're in danger too!

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:47.660
Damn!

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:03.900
Jack!

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:05.710
What happened?

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:09.110
I don't know.  A Dark Signer 
battled against Aki Izayoi.

00:19:09.110 --> 00:19:11.030
Like I thought, a Dark Signer.

00:19:11.030 --> 00:19:12.200
Where's Izayoi?

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:13.870
Still inside.

00:19:13.870 --> 00:19:14.880
What?

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:16.560
Hey!  Wait, Jack!

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:18.100
It's too dangerous!  Come back!

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:26.500
Is anyone here?

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:29.770
If you are, answer me!

00:19:36.060 --> 00:19:38.940
These glasses…  Can it be?

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:48.140
Carly…

00:19:48.140 --> 00:19:49.570
Carly!

00:19:49.570 --> 00:19:51.140
Carly!

00:19:51.140 --> 00:19:53.000
Are you here, Carly?

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:57.330
Izayoi!

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:01.770
Hang in there!

00:20:01.770 --> 00:20:04.010
Carly!

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:05.100
Damn!

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:17.270
What happened?

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:19.960
Did I really…

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:24.100
Divine, vanish into eternal darkness!

00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:38.540
Did I really do something that horrible?

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:41.920
What's this Duel Disk?

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:43.910
What's this mark?

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:47.070
Jack!  Help me, Jack!

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:53.850
Carly, this is your destiny.

00:20:58.490 --> 00:21:00.150
Misty?

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:05.020
You were chosen, just like me.

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:06.320
Chosen?

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:10.070
Yes.  We were chosen by the god of death.

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:13.120
The moment death visited you…

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:16.930
You strongly wished that 
you didn't want to die.

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:23.520
The god granted our wishes.

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:30.620
We're no longer inhabitants of 
this world.  This mark is proof.

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:35.850
No…  It can't be true!

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:43.770
It's fine.  It's too much 
to take in right now.

00:21:43.770 --> 00:21:49.040
However, you'll understand 
your own destiny soon enough.

00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:52.810
It's fine.

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:57.940
I'll help you cope for now.

00:22:13.700 --> 00:22:18.170
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:18.530 --> 00:22:23.240
We will build our own future

00:22:23.710 --> 00:22:28.680
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:29.140 --> 00:22:33.850
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:39.450 --> 00:22:48.990
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:54.570
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:54.630 --> 00:22:59.270
Even if it loses its light

00:22:59.740 --> 00:23:04.540
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:23:04.540 --> 00:23:09.010
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:23:09.220 --> 00:23:14.600
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:23:14.720 --> 00:23:19.400
This journey has no end

00:23:19.690 --> 00:23:24.930
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:25.360 --> 00:23:30.170
Hear my voice
